VI. TYPING PERFORMANCE EVALUATION To evaluate the typing performance of our keyboard, we ran an additional typing experiment. Speciﬁcally, the purpose of this experiment was to determine how effective our techniques are in terms of improving typing speed, errors, and accuracy. For comparison, we implemented three different virtual keyboards including our proposed virtual keyboard.
